OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled and road warnings
OL,4,Aas Storm Boelo sweeps into Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FForecasters say the strong winds could
OL,7,Fresult in injury, flying debris, power
OL,8,Fcuts and damage to trees and buildings.
